message.content:
{
  "summary": "This bill would require a public school principal to remove a student from any classroom or school-sponsored event or activity if an order of protection has been issued to protect another student in the same school. The school or school district would be required to provide the removed student with alternative instruction for any classes they miss. This requirement would apply only for the duration of the order of protection. The bill would take effect upon becoming law and would apply to orders of protection entered on or after that date."
}
